  {
   "id": "morkull-ragast-s-rage-223730@1.0.7",
   "gameId": "morkull-ragast-s-rage-223730",
   "displayName": "Update 1.0.7",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2025-05-22T10:10:24.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "A message from your beloved god, Morkull",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "One time ago the video game Morkull Ragast's Rage (starring yours truly, the god of death and darkness himself) came out.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Some of you mortals have managed to get me to escape from this blissful videogame — I guess that’s why I’m writing this.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "And in case you haven’t… maybe it’s time to stop browsing this page and finally add it to your library.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Anyway, I want to say THANK YOU to all the people who have played it.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "I will have no choice but to have pity on the kitty (inside joke for those who have played it, hehe).",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Version 1.0.7 - Update & Fixes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Now I have my developers working and paying special attention to your feedback to give you the best experience possible.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Be patient though… they’re only three mere humans and I can’t give them any more whiplash (believe me, I’ve tried).",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "In the meantime, for the most clueless, here’s what the latest patch includes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Enemy ‘Bat’: Reduced damage applied by these enemies.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Key: Changed position of the key obtained after the rolling rocks in ‘Purple Mile’.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Laser Balance: Reduced the number of laser traps in ‘The Retreat’ area.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Death Penalty: Reduced from 50% to 25%.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Various minor bug fixes.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Support my tyranny (with a positive review)",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "If you liked Morkull Ragast's Rage, I encourage you to leave your POSITIVE REVIEW.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "You can't imagine how much it helps my boys — and despite months of starvation, they still dream of eating again someday (how weak humans are).",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Help me spread evil, atrocities, and tyranny all over the world!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Signed by the most infamous god: Morkull.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Kisses.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
